<title>JAPAN: WestLB Securities joins OSE, PaineWebber quits.</title>
<headline>WestLB Securities joins OSE, PaineWebber quits.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Osaka Securities Exchange said on Monday that Hong Kong-based WestLB Securities Pacific Ltd has become a member of the stock exchange while PaineWebber Asia Ltd has withdrawn from the exchange.</p>
<p>WestLB is a unit of Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale, an OSE official said.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Asia is a unit of the PaineWebber Group Inc of the United States, a PaineWebber Asia official said.</p>
<p>The OSE did not elaborate further.</p>
</text>
